## Interface: 16001
## Title: SellAdvice
## Notes: One line in item tooltips: disenchant, vendor or auction, whichever brings the most, from Auctionator's scanned prices. A gold coin marks the quest choice worth the most. With full bags, a red cross in Baganator marks the item cheapest to drop. Hold Alt for the workings.
